    description: "Concept audit 2026-10-21/22 (pinned dev e9215548f6; write-up ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/concept_audit_10212026/concept-audit-vocabulary-since-0923_10222026.md). F6. OWNER DECISION 2026-10-22: 'yes' to: command-line arguments count as both host_secret and untrusted_input (the launcher chose them, as it chose stdin, which is ipc_recv / untrusted_input per ADR-0050); document.cookie moves from env_read to browser storage (medium reading of ADR-0050) but keeps its host_secret label on the row. Measure first, as WI-lanos: pre-register PLAN (cohort chosen by argv / cookie call-site density across languages: python sys.argv, go os.Args, node process.argv, rust std::env::args, js document.cookie), BEFORE/AFTER arms on dev, seeded sample of added situations judged on ADR-0046's two axes, then the owner rules on the delta. Depends on F6a (axiom amendment) for the cookie half."  # 3427
